  "description": "Jin-Wol Ma, better known in the martial realm as the ‘Mad Demon’, once stained the earth with blood in his pursuit to become the pinnacle of all living things. That was until his final battle with the Five Supreme Masters, where the leader of the Fire Dragon sect sealed him away using the Demon-Sealing Sword. Now, three thousand years later, Jin-Wol awakens, but he is no longer on Earth. Instead, he finds himself surrounded by hostile alien civilizations. Will Jin-Wol rise once again to aim for the peak of all living creatures? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
